{"code":"PK03","wikidata":"Q13021842","wikipedia":{"en":"Sanambin Nam MRT station","th":"สถานีสนามบินน้ำ"},"summary":{"en":"Sanambin Nam station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Tiwanon Road, near Sanambin Nam intersection in Mueang Nonthaburi district, Nonthaburi province. The station has four exits.","th":"สถานีสนามบินน้ำ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนติวานนท์ในพื้นที่อำเภอเมืองนนทบุรี จังหวัดนนทบุรี"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Sanambin_Nam_Station_20231125-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT